"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"There is no complete eligible award journey in this packet. For a first follow-up, the January 9 United summary is useful because it reports the most seats among these award leads and a modest observed tax amount; the tradeoff is that it has no timed itinerary, so you cannot yet assess its actual routing or schedule.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A26@2027-01-09/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"January 9 United award summary\",\"v\":\"It reports economy, 55,000 United miles and 9 seats, with USD 16.20 in observed award taxes. The quote scope is unknown, and the date-only summary is not a timed itinerary or a complete journey.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A12@2027-01-04/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"January 4 Alaska award summary\",\"v\":\"This is another date to check: it reports 8 seats and 42,500 Alaska miles, with USD 50.90 in observed award taxes. The points are from a different program than the United lead and are not directly comparable; the higher reported tax amount is not a like-for-like price without known quote scope. It too is date-only, not a timed itinerary.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A1@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"January 1 Aeroplan award summary\",\"v\":\"This date matches the cash-search date and the summary reports 2 seats, 65,000 Aeroplan points, and CAD 116.50 in observed award taxes. Its smaller reported seat count and unknown quote scope are limitations, and it provides no timed itinerary. Aeroplan points are not directly comparable with the other programs’ points.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C2@2027-01-01T12:00-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"January 1 cash baseline\",\"v\":\"The cash search returned a one-stop EVA Air itinerary via TPE and an observed USD 686 fare. Its price scope is unknown, so this is a baseline—not a per-person or all-in comparison with the award tax quotes. The search returned one traveler; that does not establish the quote’s price scope.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The search requested one traveler, but the award leads do not state how many travelers their reported seats or quotes support. None supplies award timing or a complete itinerary. Check the award providers for a full timed routing, current availability, and quote scope—especially for January 9—before comparing it with the cash baseline.\"}]}"
